-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8","children":"全面讲解 Next.js 14 App Router 的核心概念、路由机制、数据获取方式以及迁移策略。"}],["$","hr",null,{"className":"border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 mb-8"}],["$","$L4",null,{"content":"# Next.js 14 App Router 深度解析\n\nNext.js 14 的 App Router 带来了革命性的变化，彻底改变了 React 应用的路由和数据获取方式。\n\n## 视频内容概览\n\n本视频涵盖以下核心主题：\n\n### 1. App Router 基础\n- 文件系统路由约定\n- Layout 和 Template 的区别\n- Route Groups 和 Dynamic Routes\n- Parallel Routes 和 Intercepting Routes\n\n### 2. 服务端组件深度讲解\n- Server Components vs Client Components\n- 组件树中的数据流\n- 渐进式客户端化策略\n\n### 3. 数据获取模式\n- `fetch` API 的扩展\n- 缓存策略（Cache, Revalidate, No-Store）\n- Server Actions 实战\n\n### 4. 迁移指南\n- Pages Router → App Router 的迁移路径\n- 常见陷阱和解决方案\n\n## 适合人群\n\n- 有 React 基础，想学习 Next.js 的开发者\n- 使用 Pages Router，计划迁移到 App Router 的开发者\n- 想了解服务端组件最佳实践的工程师\n\n## 观看建议\n\n建议配合官方文档一起观看，动手实践视频中的每个示例代码。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between items-center","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/videos","className":"inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-6 py-3 glass rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-500 hover:text-white transition-colors","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","fill":"none","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","strokeWidth":1.5,"stroke":"currentColor","aria-hidden":"true","data-slot":"icon","aria-labelledby":"$undefined","className":"w-5 h-5","children":[null,["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","d":"M10.5 19.5 3 12m0 0 7.5-7.5M3 12h18"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"查看更多视频"}]]}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1GJ411x7h7","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-6 py-3 bg-primary-500 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","fill":"none","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","strokeWidth":1.5,"stroke":"currentColor","aria-hidden":"true","data-slot":"icon","aria-labelledby":"$undefined","className":"w-5 h-5","c